infographic sequence-pyramid-simple
data
  title The fallback ladder: best to worst
  desc An open breaker rejects instantly — into what? Pick the best option the call site allows; fail-fast is the floor.
  sequences
    - label Degraded-but-correct response
      desc Drop the broken feature, render the rest of the page
    - label Last-known-good cache
      desc Serve a slightly stale value instead of nothing
    - label Static default
      desc Generic list, empty array, or a sensible zero
    - label Queue for later (outbox)
      desc Writes: accept now, process on recovery
    - label Fail-fast 503 + Retry-After
      desc The floor — clean error beats a hung 30 s request
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #0ea5e9 #8b5cf6
